%N A163880 Number of nXnXn triangular binary arrays with all 1s connected, and all vertices 1.
%C A163880 Can be computed using a(n) = D(n,0) - 3*D(n,1) + 3*D(n,2) - D(n,3), where D(n,k) is the number of connected (non-null) induced subgraphs in the triangular grid graph with n vertices on each each side and k of the 3 corner vertices removed. - _Andrew Howroyd_, Aug 31 2026
